{"id":"n83179-1-7","stage":3,"title":"농촌 · 农村","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83179-1-7-1","ko":"농촌 풍경이 정말 아름답네요.","zh":"乡村的景色真是美极了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"농촌","meaning":"农村","explanation":"농촌：农村","readings":[{"term":"농촌","audio":"/audio/ac8c03dff4197e6f30ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83179","senseId":"1","lemma":"농촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농촌","audio":"/audio/ac8c03dff4197e6f30ca.mp3"}},{"text":"풍경이","meaning":"风景，风光，景色，景致","explanation":"풍경：风景，风光，景色，景致；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"풍경","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72392","senseId":"1","lemma":"풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"풍경이","audio":"/audio/7a3e157e06d413ac5869.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"아름답네요.","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름답네요","audio":"/audio/ff5aed70fe70a778853e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac8c03dff4197e6f","term":"농촌","zh":"农村","audio":"/audio/ac8c03dff4197e6f30ca.mp3","entryId":"83179","definition":"从事农业生产的人所聚居的村子。","pronunciation":["농촌"]},{"id":"64d560d21687616f","term":"풍경","zh":"风景，风光，景色，景致","audio":"/audio/64d560d21687616f77d3.mp3","entryId":"72392","definition":"大自然或某一地区的美景。","pronunciation":["풍경"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]}],"audio":"/audio/737094e8ea349212ccd8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83179-1-7-2","ko":"네. 가을이 되니 벼가 황금빛으로 물들었어요.","zh":"是的，到了秋天，稻田都变成了金黄色。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"가을이","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가을이","audio":"/audio/9c786870b862ca6b7399.mp3"}},{"text":"되니","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되니","audio":"/audio/49977e7991da87edfe97.mp3"}},{"text":"벼가","meaning":"水稻","explanation":"벼：水稻；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벼","audio":"/audio/e700a159a08353b47927.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14469","senseId":"1","lemma":"벼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벼가","audio":"/audio/b113d9563c6ae3c78673.mp3"}},{"text":"황금빛으로","meaning":"黄金色，金色","explanation":"황금빛：黄金色，金色；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"황금빛","audio":"/audio/64f75c47d388a0d2a0b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87395","senseId":"1","lemma":"황금빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"황금빛으로","audio":"/audio/fdd73a34b11089a23d87.mp3"}},{"text":"물들었어요.","meaning":"染色","explanation":"물들다：染色；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调